# Marfan syndrome external news feed source package (pipe-delimited)
#
# These sources are separate from the Marfan condition pack because their
# publisher permissions are restrictive, work-specific, unverified, or involve
# an intermediary index. Every source is disabled by default. Installing this
# package requires acceptance of Health Signal's external news feed sources
# agreement. Review the current publisher terms before enabling a source.
#
# Health Signal displays headline, date, publisher attribution and an outbound
# link only for these rows. It does not reproduce article bodies or images.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
medlineplus-marfan|MedlinePlus · Marfan Syndrome|https://medlineplus.gov/feeds/topics/marfansyndrome.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|MedlinePlus / U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official topic RSS with restricted reuse|30 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|MedlinePlus offers the topic RSS feed, but its content-use policy limits feeds to personal use and does not authorize use in websites or information services|Not authorized by the published RSS terms|Credit MedlinePlus and the U.S. National Library of Medicine and link to the original page|https://medlineplus.gov/about/using/usingcontent/|https://medlineplus.gov/about/contactus.html|Verified live Marfan-specific RSS endpoint. Disabled pending permission appropriate for Health Signal; linked pages can include licensed third-party material.
who-news-marfan|World Health Organization · News|https://www.who.int/rss-feeds/news-english.xml|News|headlineOnly|false|World Health Organization|Official international public-health news feed|30 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|WHO content is not uniformly public domain. WHO and third-party copyright and licensing notices apply to each linked work|Not verified for the feed; WHO states that commercial uses can require permission|Credit the World Health Organization and link to the original item without implying endorsement|https://www.who.int/about/policies/publishing/copyright|https://www.who.int/about/contact-us|Verified live broad RSS endpoint and locally filtered for explicit Marfan relevance. No WHO logo, article body, image or full summary is reproduced.
marfan-foundation-news|The Marfan Foundation|https://marfan.org/feed/|Community|headlineOnly|false|The Marfan Foundation|Condition-specific nonprofit source; permission under review|30 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|The publisher provides a live RSS feed, but no RSS-specific redistribution permission was located during review|Not verified|Credit The Marfan Foundation and link to the original item|https://marfan.org/disclaimer/|https://marfan.org/contact/|Verified live official RSS endpoint. Disabled pending publisher authorization; no article body, image or full summary is reproduced.
patient-info-health-marfan|Patient.info · Patient information|https://patient.info/health/rss|Research|headlineOnly|false|Patient / Navigate Health Ltd|Broad clinical information RSS with restrictive general terms|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|Patient's RSS page permits publishers and healthcare sites to embed its feeds without licensing or API access; its general terms separately restrict structured medical-resource and automated content reuse|RSS embedding is expressly described, while broader structured reuse requires written permission|Credit Patient.info and link to the original article|https://patient.info/terms-and-conditions|https://patient.info/contact|Verified responsive broad RSS endpoint and locally filtered for explicit Marfan relevance. Disabled by default and distributed only through the agreement-gated external source package; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
google-news-marfan-news|Google News · Marfan syndrome|https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=%28%22Marfan%20syndrome%22%20OR%20%22Marfan%27s%20syndrome%22%20OR%20%22Marfan%20disease%22%20OR%20FBN1%29&hl=en-GB&gl=GB&ceid=GB:en|News|google|false|Google News|Intermediary search feed|30 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, named publisher and outbound link only|Google News terms and each underlying publisher's terms apply. Authorization for release use has not been recorded|Not verified|Credit the publisher identified by Google News and link to the original item|https://news.google.com/terms||Not approved for release use. Disabled by default; no article body, image or summary is reproduced.
